+ * (SkcController.sys, Dell package V9X4F): the sensor drivers request
+ * 1200/2800/1800/2800/1800 mV; the user-facing sensor uses AUX1/AUX2/VSIO,
+ * the world-facing sensor uses CORE/ANA/VIO/VCM/VSIO. Same values as the
+ * in-tree Latitude 7212 data and the Latitude 5285 series.
